<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie policy | GSN Farma Labs Group"
  description="Information about the use of cookies on the GSN Farma Labs Group website and how to manage them."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="subpage-hero-e__inner">
      <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="legal-content__updated"><strong>Last updated:</strong> July 30, 2026</p>

      <p><strong>GSN FARMA LABS, S.L.U.</strong> (hereinafter, "<strong>GSN FARMA</strong>") with Tax ID B10958932 and registered office for these purposes at Calle del Llobregat nº 28, CP 08223 Terrassa (Barcelona), through this Cookies Policy, demonstrates the commitment acquired with applicable legislation on the use of cookies, providing information so that users can understand what type of cookies are used and under what purpose, with the aim of providing transparency regarding the data processed on navigation of our website <a href="https://www.gsnfarma.com">www.gsnfarma.com</a> (hereinafter, the "<strong>Website</strong>").</p>
      <p>This policy is reviewed periodically to ensure its currency, so it may be modified. We recommend that you visit it regularly to be informed of any updates regarding it.</p>
      <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small data files that are received in the terminal from the visited Website and are used to record certain navigation interactions on it, storing data that can be updated and retrieved. These files are stored in the device being used by the user and contain data; web beacons, pixels or other similar files can also do this. We use the term "cookies" in this policy to refer to all files that collect information in this way.</p>
      <h2>2. Why do we use cookies?</h2>
      <p>GSN FARMA uses strictly necessary and essential cookies so that you can use our Website and allow you to move freely, use our secure areas, personalize the different options, etc.</p>
      <p>Additionally, GSN FARMA uses cookies that collect data relating to Website usage analysis. These are used to help improve the user service, measuring Website usage and performance, to optimize and customize it.</p>
      <p>The Website uses or may use links that allow a link with other websites. GSN FARMA does not control the cookies used by these external websites. For more information about cookies from these external websites, we advise reviewing their own cookies policies.</p>
      <h2>3. What type of cookies do we use?</h2>
      <p><strong>Technical cookies:</strong> These are essential and strictly necessary cookies for the correct functioning of the Website and the use of the different options and services it offers. For example, those that serve for session maintenance, response time management, performance or validation of options, use of security elements, to share content with social networks, etc.</p>
      <p><strong>Preference or customization cookies: </strong>These are cookies that allow you to personalize your experience when interacting with the Website, such as language or the content and appearance of the Website based on your preferences, device or region.</p>
      <p><strong>Analytical cookies: </strong>These are cookies used to develop browsing profiles and understand user preferences in order to improve the offer of products and services.</p>
      <p><strong>Behavioral advertising cookies:</strong> These are cookies that allow storing user information to develop a specific profile and display advertising based on it.</p>
      <h2>4. What happens if I accept the Cookies Policy?</h2>
      <p>To comply with applicable legislation, we must ask for your permission to manage cookies. If you decide not to authorize processing by indicating your disagreement to us, we would only use technical cookies, since they are essential for navigation of our Website. In this case, we would not store any other cookies.</p>
      <p>Accepting our Cookies Policy allows us to improve the Website to provide you with optimal access and give you a more effective and personalized service. We inform you that if you block or do not accept the installation of cookies, but continue browsing the Website, it is possible that certain services will not be available without the use of these or that you cannot access certain services nor take full advantage of everything the Website offers you.</p>
      <h2>5. How can I disable cookies?</h2>
      <p>You can withdraw your consent related to the use of cookies by pressing the button that appears at the bottom left of the screen. When you press this button, the cookies banner will open again, with its configuration panel, so you can manage your preferences, as well as choose to reject or accept the use of cookies.</p>
      <p>Additionally, we inform you that all browsers allow you to make changes to disable cookie settings. This is why most browsers offer the ability to manage cookies for more precise control over privacy.</p>
      <p>Please note that if you reject or delete the Website's navigation cookies, we will not be able to maintain your preferences, some Website features will not be operational, we will not be able to offer you personalized services, and each time you go to navigate our Website we will have to request your authorization again for the use of cookies.</p>
      <p>If you still decide to modify the configuration of your access to the Website, we inform you that it is possible to delete cookies or prevent this information from being recorded on your computer at any time by modifying the configuration parameters of your browser:</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/61416?hl=es&amp;co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop">Google Chrome cookies settings</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/es-es/guide/safari/sfri11471/mac">Safari cookies settings</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/es/kb/Deshabilitar%20cookies%20de%20terceros">Firefox cookies settings</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/es-es/edge/manage-cookies-in-microsoft-edge-view-allow-block-delete-and-use">Microsoft Edge cookies settings</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>These browsers are subject to updates or modifications, so we cannot guarantee that they will fully comply with your browser version. It is also possible that you use a different browser than those covered in the previous links. To avoid these mismatches, you can access directly from your browser options which are generally found in the "Options" menu, in the "Privacy" section. For more information, consult your browser's help.</p>
      <h2>6. Changes to the Cookies Policy</h2>
      <p>This policy is effective as of the publication date indicated in the header.</p>
      <p>Any changes that GSN FARMA makes to this Cookies Policy will be published on the Website. If the changes are significant, we may notify you by email or clearly indicate on the Website's home page that the policy has been updated.</p>
      <h2>7. Additional information</h2>
      <p>If you have a query related to the processing of your personal data or the operation of cookies on the Website, you can contact GSN FARMA by email at <a href="mailto:info@gsnfarma.com">info@gsnfarma.com</a>.</p>
      <p>For more information about the processing of your personal data, you can consult our <a href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> at the bottom of the Website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
